                                <button id="help-performance-full" style="padding:0.35rem 0.85rem;border-radius:6px;background:#065f46;border:1px solid #059669;color:#a7f3d0;font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;">FULL (4K Native)</button>
